      "block_preview_text": "Attend a Kana meeting with extension officers in your area to select the best rice variety and create a crop calendar for the season. Request instructions on how to use water more efficiently and appoint a water controller. Learn how to use seeds of the most adapted rice varieties for the area and season. Follow the recommendations of the Rice Research and Development Institute for the MAHA season. Form buns and plaster to hold water for every season. Place a field water tube to monitor the wate",
