      "block_preview_text": "Irrigate the field to five centimeters above the surface level and allow draining until 15 centimeters below surface level. Irrigate based on weeds observed while keeping water 15 centimeters below the surface level. Maintain water level 0 to 5 centimeters above the surface level two weeks after flowering. Prepare a 3.5 month variety with the right moisture level (22-25%) for harvest at week 12. Use moisture measurement services at One Stop Super to reduce grain damages.",
